25-      # The build/upload delegate to `just ios-*`, so a recipe change can break the lane.
26-      - "justfile"
27:      # The imported recipe files the root justfile pulls in (the iOS build recipes
28:      # live in just/ios.just); a broken import fails `just` at parse time.
29-      - "just/release.just"
30-      - "just/ios.just"
31-      # The shared iOS toolchain/patch scripts live in scripts/ios/ (per-app
32-      # scripts are thin wrappers). PDS-only scripts directly under scripts/
33-      # (bruno-parity, font-parity, ...) are deliberately excluded.
34-      # The shared Swift sources for the wallet's Notification Service Extension.
35-      # Not a cargo crate, so the dependency graph above cannot reach them, and no lane
36-      # compiles Swift — so this trigger exists to bring a change under the template and
37-      # file-existence gates, which are the only automated check these sources have.
38-      # Deliberately absent from admin-testflight.yml: the NSE target is gated to the
39-      # wallet's bundle id, so the console's project compiles none of this.
40-      - "ios/**"
